{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104033117995-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104041510\"/><p>起火單位外牆熏黑。(梁國雄攝)</p><p>今日(4日)凌晨3時15分，九龍灣宏光道80號麗晶花園22座低層一單位起火，多人報案求助。消防到場拖喉撲救，其後將火救熄。涉事單候位兩男女疑吸入濃煙不適送院，男子逃生時赤腳，他面及雙腳熏黑，自行步上救護車。涉事單位外牆被熏黑，火警起因則有待調查。事件中，逾150住客疏散落樓暫避。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T20:20:50.744952+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T19:31:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:34.124443+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:34.124443+00:00","content_hash":"5ba7780822c392c0e987ef7e5901b847434c0b281efe68212cd09a21e3d7dbcb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}